  "Habit Streak Tracker: DotHabit (App Store ID 1439938837; Japanese title 習慣記録で継続 DotHabit 運動・勉強・目標達成アプリ) by Mono Incorporated (bundle com.supernora.DotHabit) — a Japan-first dot-grid habit tracker: 2019 – early 2024 a free app with banner ads (a premium tier existed by Jan 2021); May 2024 an update added video ads on ordinary check-ins, put back-dated logging behind a video ad and limited new habits for free users; by 14 Dec 2024 the video ads were replaced by banners; from 2025 a subscription with a trial, a free tier capped at 6 habits and an 'AI coach' (DotBuddy) that replies to check-ins; the Japanese listing (12 Sep 2026) lists seven IAPs from ¥600 to ¥14,800 incl. DotHabit プレミアム 年額 ¥1,990, premium = multiple-habit widgets plus the AI coach; listing 4.7★ from ~17,000 JP ratings; iPhone, Mac, Vision",
